&lt;p&gt;Can you please assess the impact of this issue?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Peter&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="209832" author="jhammond" created="Thu, 28 Sep 2017 14:09:12 +0000">&lt;p&gt;There is no impact to production systems. The &lt;tt&gt;remove_archive_on_last_unlink&lt;/tt&gt; parameter was introduced in 2.9.58. The test should be skipped for MDSs before 2.10.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
